<title>SWITZERLAND: UBS won't comment on CA bid.</title>
<headline>UBS won't comment on CA bid.</headline>
<dateline>ZURICH 1996-12-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Union Bank of Switzerland (UBS) declined to confirm or deny a statement by Austria's finance ministry that it had joined a consortium led by EA-Generali that is bidding for Austria's 70-percent stake in Creditanstalt.</p>
<p>&quot;I don't know about this...I cannot confirm this,&quot; a UBS spokesman told Reuters.  </p>
<p>Asked whether he was denying the report, the spokesman said no.</p>
<p>Austria's finance ministry said in a statement that UBS was helping the consortium top its bid so that it covered the government's entire stake in Creditanstalt.</p>
<p>-- Zurich Newsroom, +41-1-631 7340</p>
</text>
